{%- comment -%}
  The label, on the page.

  Everything here is transcribed from the finalised cartons and the manufacturer's
  nutrition data — not written for the website. A nutraceutical sold in India has
  to carry its actives, its full ingredient list, its nutrition panel, its net
  quantity and its warnings, and until this snippet existed the product pages
  carried none of them: "What's inside" fell back to "Full ingredient list coming
  soon."

  The numbers are shared across all three SKUs because the base gummy is the same
  (1 gummy ≈ 3.5 g, 30 per pack, 105 g net). Only the actives and the flavour
  differ, so only those are switched per handle.

  If a figure here ever disagrees with a printed carton, the carton wins and this
  file is wrong — it is a transcription, not a source.

  Parameters
    product   required  the Shopify product object. {% render %} has isolated
                        scope, so it must be passed explicitly.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign h = product.handle -%}

{%- case h -%}
  {%- when 'brain-booster-gummies' -%}
    {%- assign flavour = 'Mango' -%}
    {%- assign actives = 'Bacopa Monnieri Leaf Extract — 60 mg' -%}
  {%- when 'melatonin-gummies' -%}
    {%- assign flavour = 'Cherry' -%}
    {%- assign actives = 'Melatonin — 5 mg|Chamomile Extract — 5 mg|Ashwagandha Extract — 2 mg|Valerian Root Extract — 2 mg|Passion Flower Extract — 2 mg|Lemon Extract — 2 mg|Magnesium — 0.2 mg' -%}
  {%- when 'eye-care-gummies' -%}
    {%- assign flavour = 'Orange' -%}
    {%- assign actives = 'Bilberry Fruit Extract — 100 mg|Vitamin C — 35 mg|Grape Seed Extract — 25 mg|Lutein — 5 mg|Lycopene — 2 mg|Zeaxanthin — 1 mg|Vitamin B6 — 0.9 mg|Vitamin B2 — 0.6 mg|Vitamin B1 — 0.5 mg|Vitamin A — 250 IU|Vitamin E — 5 IU' -%}
{%- endcase -%}

{%- case h -%}
  {%- when 'brain-booster-gummies' -%}
    {%- assign goodtoknow = 'Bacopa Monnieri Leaf Extract|A botanical traditionally used in Ayurveda and studied for its potential role in memory and cognitive function. Evidence varies by extract, dose and duration.|FOS (Fructooligosaccharides)|A type of prebiotic fibre.|Pectin|A plant-derived gelling agent that gives gummies their texture.|Citric Acid &amp; Trisodium Citrate|Help regulate acidity and flavour.|Mango flavour|Adds a fruity, tropical taste.' -%}
  {%- when 'melatonin-gummies' -%}
    {%- assign goodtoknow = 'Melatonin|A hormone naturally produced by the body that helps regulate the sleep–wake cycle.|Ashwagandha Extract|Studied for possible effects on stress and sleep; evidence varies.|Chamomile|Traditionally used in calming preparations.|Valerian Root &amp; Passion Flower|Traditionally used in relaxation and sleep-related preparations; evidence is mixed or limited.|Magnesium|An essential mineral involved in normal muscle and nerve function.|Cherry flavour|Adds a sweet, rounded taste.' -%}
  {%- when 'eye-care-gummies' -%}
    {%- assign goodtoknow = 'Vitamin A|Contributes to the maintenance of normal vision.|Vitamins C &amp; E|Help protect cells from oxidative stress.|Vitamin B2 (Riboflavin)|Contributes to normal vision and helps protect cells from oxidative stress.|Vitamins B1 &amp; B6|Support normal energy-yielding metabolism and nervous system function.|Lutein &amp; Zeaxanthin|Carotenoids found in the retina, particularly the macula.|Bilberry Fruit Extract|Contains anthocyanins and has been studied for eye-related effects, though evidence for specific benefits is limited.|Grape Seed Extract|Contains polyphenols with antioxidant activity.|Lycopene|A carotenoid with antioxidant activity.|Orange flavour|Adds a bright, citrusy taste.' -%}
{%- endcase -%}

{%- if actives != blank -%}
<div class="gpf">

  <div class="gpf-block">
    <h3 class="gpf-h">What's actually in it</h3>
    <p class="gpf-note">Per gummy</p>
    <ul class="gpf-list">
      {%- assign rows = actives | split: '|' -%}
      {%- for row in rows -%}
        {%- assign cells = row | split: '—' -%}
        <li><span>{{ cells[0] | strip }}</span><b>{{ cells[1] | strip }}</b></li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
    <p class="gpf-sub">
      <b>Other ingredients:</b> Pectin (INS 440), Fructooligosaccharides (FOS),
      Citric Acid (INS 330), Trisodium Citrate (INS 331(iii)), nature-identical
      {{ flavour | downcase }} flavour.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="gpf-block">
    <h3 class="gpf-h">Nutrition</h3>
    <p class="gpf-note">Serving size 1 gummy (approx. 3.5 g) · 30 servings per pack</p>
    <table class="gpf-table">
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Energy</th><td>13.2 kcal</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Total Fat</th><td>0 g</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Total Carbohydrate</th><td>3.3 g</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Added Sugars</th><td>0 g</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Protein</th><td>0 g</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="gpf-sub">Net quantity 105 g. %RDA values per ICMR Guidelines 2020 for a moderately active adult.</p>
  </div>

  {%- if goodtoknow != blank -%}
  <div class="gpf-block">
    <h3 class="gpf-h">Good to know</h3>
    <p class="gpf-note">What each ingredient is</p>
    <dl class="gpf-dl">
      {%- assign pairs = goodtoknow | split: '|' -%}
      {%- for i in (0..19) -%}
        {%- assign ni = i | times: 2 -%}
        {%- assign vi = ni | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- if pairs[ni] != blank -%}
          <dt>{{ pairs[ni] }}</dt><dd>{{ pairs[vi] }}</dd>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </dl>
    <p class="gpf-fine">These are educational notes about the ingredients, not
      health claims about the product, and not a substitute for medical advice.</p>
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="gpf-block">
    <h3 class="gpf-h">Before you take it</h3>
    <ul class="gpf-plain">
      <li>Take 1 gummy daily, or as directed by a healthcare professional.</li>
      <li>Do not exceed the recommended usage.</li>
      <li>Not for medicinal use, and not a substitute for a varied diet.</li>
      <li>Consult a healthcare professional if you are pregnant, breastfeeding,
          taking medication or managing a medical condition.</li>
      <li>Check the ingredient list before use if you have allergies or sensitivities.</li>
      <li>Store cool and dry, away from sunlight and moisture. Keep tightly closed
          and out of reach of children.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>
{%- endif -%}
